## 7. Concept Coverage Matrix

| Category | Concepts | Where it lives in this project |
|---|---|---|
| **1. Core Foundation** | Cluster, Node, Pod, Namespace | `kind` 4-node cluster; 7 namespaces |
| **2. Control Plane** | Scheduler, API Server, Controller Manager | Inspect real static pods in `kube-system` |
| **3. Workloads** | Deployment, StatefulSet, Jobs, CronJobs | frontend/backend (Deployment, from kuma-demo images), Postgres (CNPG), Redis (StatefulSet), migration (Job), reports (CronJob) |
| **4. Containers & Health** | Init Containers, Sidecars, Probes | `wait-for-postgres` init container, `log-shipper` sidecar, liveness/readiness on backend (all newly added — upstream has none) |
| **5. Networking** | Services, Ingress, LoadBalancer | ClusterIP internally, ingress-nginx for routing, MetalLB for LoadBalancer demo |
| **6. Storage** | PV, PVC, StorageClass | `local-path` StorageClass; PVCs for Postgres + Redis (upstream had neither) |
| **7. Config & Resources** | ConfigMaps, Secrets, Resource Limits | DB creds/JWT as Secret; requests/limits on all app pods (upstream had none on app pods) |
| **8. Security** | RBAC, Roles, Service Accounts | `api-backend-sa` + least-privilege `Role`; cross-namespace `ClusterRole`/`RoleBinding` |
| **9. Scaling** | HPA, VPA, Cluster Autoscaler, taints, tolerations, affinity | HPA on backend (CPU); VPA recommend-only on frontend (stretch); taint/toleration on db node; pod anti-affinity across app nodes |
| **10. Tools Ecosystem** | kubectl, Helm, Kustomize, CRD, Operator | kubectl throughout; Helm for infra add-ons; Kustomize base+overlays for the app; CNPG `Cluster` CRD as Operator example |
| **Bonus: Observability** | Monitoring/Logging | kube-prometheus-stack, `ServiceMonitor` on backend, one Grafana dashboard, one alert rule |

**Note on Cluster Autoscaler:** no honest way to run it on a laptop (needs a real cloud API). Document it conceptually; optionally script a manual "add a kind worker node" exercise to simulate the effect.

