## 8. Build Roadmap (12 phases)

| # | Phase | Key actions | Validate by |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Prerequisites | Install WSL2, Docker Desktop, kubectl, kind, helm | all version checks pass |
| 1 | Cluster foundation | `kind create cluster`; label/taint nodes; create namespaces | `kubectl get nodes -o wide`; control-plane pods visible in `kube-system` |
| 2 | Storage & config | Install local-path-provisioner; create ConfigMaps/Secrets | test PVC binds instantly |
| 3 | Adapt & deploy kuma-demo workloads | Pull frontend/backend images; strip Kuma bits from `kuma-demo-aio.yaml`; rewrite service DNS/ports; deploy to `webapp` ns | app responds via port-forward, items visible in UI |
| 4 | Stateful workloads | Install CNPG operator, apply `Cluster` CRD; apply Redis StatefulSet + PVC; run migration Job | pods in `data` ns; data survives pod deletion |
| 5 | Health patterns | Add init container + sidecar + probes to backend | readiness fails without restart when DB killed |
| 6 | Networking | Install ingress-nginx + MetalLB; create Ingress | `curl http://minishop.local` works; MetalLB IP reachable from WSL2 |
| 7 | Security | ServiceAccounts, Role/RoleBinding, ResourceQuota/LimitRange | `kubectl auth can-i` returns expected result |
| 8 | Scaling | metrics-server (`--kubelet-insecure-tls`); HPA on backend; taints/tolerations/affinity | `kubectl get hpa -w` shows scale-up under load |
| 9 | Scheduled work | Deploy report CronJob | `kubectl get cronjob,jobs -n webapp` shows recurring runs |
| 10 | Observability | kube-prometheus-stack; ServiceMonitor; dashboard; alert | Grafana shows live panel; alert fires on demand |
| 11 | Tooling polish | Package as Helm chart + Kustomize base/overlays | both produce working deploy |
| 12 | Chaos/validation (stretch) | Kill pods, drain a node, delete PVC-backed pod, load test | self-healing observed each time |

