## 11. Definition of Done

- [ ] 4-node kind cluster up, all namespaces created
- [ ] `minishop.local` loads the kuma-demo frontend in a Windows browser; items load from the backend
- [ ] Postgres (CNPG) and Redis both persist data across pod deletion (upstream did not persist either)
- [ ] Deleting a backend pod triggers self-healing within seconds
- [ ] Killing DB connectivity fails readiness without a restart
- [ ] Load test triggers HPA scale-up, visible in `kubectl get hpa -w`
- [ ] `kubectl auth can-i` confirms RBAC least-privilege for `api-backend-sa`
- [ ] Grafana shows live metrics; one alert fires on demand
- [ ] Same app deployable via both the Helm chart and Kustomize overlays
- [ ] MetalLB assigns a real external IP to a LoadBalancer Service, verified via WSL2 curl

